            "prompt": "What do both speakers explicitly agree on?",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "label": "Understand the spoken exchange",
            "context": "A and B discuss a social situation. The first two clauses are A’s; the last two are B’s.",
            "contextLanguage": "en",
